@startuml Vista de Processos – Level 2 (US 2.2.8 – Create Vessel Visit Notification)
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor Black
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    LifeLineBorderColor Black
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantBorderColor Black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

actor "Shipping Agent Representative" as Agent
participant "<<container (C4)>>\nVisualization (UI)" as UI #87CEEB
participant "<<container (C4)>>\nVisits & Manifests" as VVM #87CEEB


activate Agent
Agent -> UI: 1: asks to create a Vessel Visit Notification (VVN)
activate UI
UI --> Agent: 1.1: ask for required data (Vessel, ETA/ETD, cargo manifest, crew info when needed)
deactivate UI
Agent -> UI: 2: provides VVN data (may be incomplete)
activate UI
UI -> VVM: 2.1: save VVN with "in progress" status
activate VVM
VVM --> UI: 2.1.1: creation confirmation
UI --> Agent: 2.2: displays confirmation
deactivate VVM
deactivate UI
deactivate Agent
